#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:5
#: 1ac56ff74fb7417ab06103ceef70962a
msgid "Members management"
msgstr "Upravljanje članov"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:7
#: 6d2a0d7ad994493faf1f6f9fbe9d66a9
msgid "One of the first contact with Galette interface after the installation, login and dashboard will be members list, main part of the system. Of course, this list will be empty for now :)"
msgstr ""
"Eden prvih stikov z vmesnikom Galette po namestitvi, prijavi in nadzorni "
"plošči bo seznam članov, glavni del sistema. Seveda bo ta seznam zaenkrat "
"prazen :)"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:9
#: 54328c7ca34b4dfd849ad8a425953a31
msgid "Let's start by creating a new member. As everywhere in Galette, mandatory fields are displayed with a red border; all other are optional. Different parts of the page (`Identity`, `Contact information`, `Galette related data` and maybe `Dynamic fields`) can be retracted clicking on their respective title."
msgstr ""
"Začnimo z ustvarjanjem novega člana. Kot povsod v Galette so obvezna polja "
"prikazana z rdečim robom; vsa ostala so neobvezna. Različne dele strani "
"(`Identiteta`,`Kontaktni podatki`,`Podatki, povezani z Galette` in "
"morda`Dinamična polja`) lahko umaknete s klikom na njihov naslov."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:11
#: 95f017b0e18d4c828683f465ab8b0c2c
msgid "`Identity` screen part adding member"
msgstr "Del zaslona »Identiteta« pri dodajanju člana"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:16
#: e2dcd313bbaf4dfdab0d8cb444552f65
msgid "`Identity` screen part editing member"
msgstr "Član urejanja dela zaslona `Identiteta`"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:21
#: d62974a5024041949a69e2f762c59c23
msgid "On date fields, you can access a calendar:"
msgstr "V poljih z datumom lahko dostopate do koledarja:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:23
#: f6ad71603def43c587780fbf3451097b
msgid "Date selection"
msgstr "Izbira datuma"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:27
#: 43b75a53cbe746519c7a4209e45bbd48
msgid "When storing a member (or any other object in Galette), page will be reloaded with all information you've entered (excepting passwords)."
msgstr ""
"Pri shranjevanju člana (ali katerega koli drugega predmeta v Galette) se bo "
"stran ponovno naložila z vsemi vnesenimi podatki (razen gesel)."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:30
#: 3a1ab6fe05a94affac58695f3d772e46
msgid "Members list"
msgstr "Seznam članov"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:32
#: e5d30f0825be457d9b4739319cc212f5
msgid "Members list allows you to:"
msgstr "Seznam članov vam omogoča:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:34
#: b11da3a7c5a7459aa3a95cce406645e6
msgid "filter and order members,"
msgstr "filtriranje in urejanje članov,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:35
#: 02405ced8ccd4086b81381efc3cdbc82
msgid "display members card,"
msgstr "prikaz članske izkaznice,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:36
#: 1e019514235345e38a8852c26de9bae4
msgid "removals,"
msgstr "selitve,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:37
#: 9b02e3d6398d48b6910d2411355ba29e
msgid "send mailings,"
msgstr "pošiljanje poštnih pošiljk,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:38
#: 7e482c581aaf4376be06505df23becb4
msgid "generate PDF labels,"
msgstr "ustvarjanje PDF nalepk,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:39
#: 852cf26546db4ddfa4ddaab1d6ac59c4
msgid "generate PDF attendance sheets,"
msgstr "ustvarite PDF-tabele prisotnosti,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:40
#: ce24195c64af492e92a3960f996abd52
msgid "generate PDF members cards,"
msgstr "ustvarite članske kartice v PDF formatu,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:41
#: 6c04a1c1dd6b49e2b0dc20c72bfd94bb
msgid "CSV exports,"
msgstr "Izvozi CSV-ja,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:42
#: 4ccc016080304c3da252f19719cc2f96
msgid "mass changes."
msgstr "množične spremembe."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:44
#: 3e2b85bea66f4846850f57c165640b8d
msgid "Each possible action per member is grouped at the end of the line, actions designed to be applied on a selection are at the bottom of the list. Plugins may add entries in both cases."
msgstr ""
"Vsako možno dejanje na člana je združeno na koncu vrstice, dejanja, "
"namenjena uporabi na izboru, pa so na dnu seznama. Vtičniki lahko v obeh "
"primerih dodajo vnose."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:47
#: ad7adbb2f6a743aaa1a223c431193801
msgid "Filter and select members"
msgstr "Filtriranje in izbiranje članov"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:49
#: e5129d61106a4b87bafc13244b5cf963
msgid "Filtering members list is documented in :ref:`search section <search_galette>`. All possibilities can be used with actions on selection."
msgstr ""
"Filtriranje seznama članov je dokumentirano v :ref:`search section "
"<search_galette>`. Vse možnosti je mogoče uporabiti z dejanji pri izbiri."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:52
#: 1080237628204c21a360550795edcc70
msgid "Mass changes"
msgstr "Masovne spremembe"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:56
#: 69bbcebdfbca4ddfb0eca5f45d03891c
msgid "Members selected in list can be edited (partially) at once."
msgstr "Člane, izbrane na seznamu, je mogoče (delno) urediti hkrati."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:58
#: 04dbebfbd3e5445188b6974101fd6a68
msgid "Mass change selected members"
msgstr "Množična sprememba izbranih članov"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:63
#: 905446a9cac54ca38f3016c8308ae4fe
msgid "Only fields with a checked checkbox at the beginning of the line will be changed. A summary will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Spremenjena bodo samo polja s označenim potrditvenim poljem na začetku "
"vrstice. Prikazan bo povzetek."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:65
#: 8962fd2a90634690a89422d17a00f27b
msgid "Summary of changes"
msgstr "Povzetek sprememb"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:71
#: 5b35de9cb35742fa9aea63acbbfa3c65
msgid "Ordering"
msgstr "Naročanje"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:72
#: fd20c74ba7a147ebb2ff1326f5aeecd8
msgid "It is possible to order members list on following fields:"
msgstr "Seznam članov je mogoče naročiti na naslednjih poljih:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:74
#: 1f305ed9dfba457a9b3d2bc841c41860
msgid "name,"
msgstr "ime,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:75
#: 2678029e5f13441f94fe48b03bbeab66
msgid "nickname,"
msgstr "vzdevek,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:76
#: 0152f94c410f4588a3ee4dc5175026bf
msgid "status,"
msgstr "status,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:77
#: ccc8c6e457fe436b851ce50208b9c0eb
msgid "contribution status,"
msgstr "status prispevka,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:78
#: 5b15532ce45e45e4a1e48093eaf70767
msgid "modification date."
msgstr "datum spremembe."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:80
#: 61d04431009f469d84b334930486691f
msgid "Most of the times, the result is transparent. Just note ordering on `status` will use status priority and ordering on `contribution status` will use creation date, contribution exemption and due date;"
msgstr ""
"Rezultat je večinoma transparenten. Upoštevajte le, da bo pri vrstnem redu "
"glede na »status« uporabljena prioriteta statusa, pri vrstnem redu glede na »"
"status prispevka« pa datum nastanka, oprostitev prispevka in datum "
"zapadlosti;"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:83
#: e0b1accf22a842c89b425d142f455a43
msgid "Configure CSV fields"
msgstr "Konfiguriraj polja CSV"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:85
#: 2014b898b6124592a3bcc925f15adb7a
msgid "Per default, CSV export for a members selection will provide same fields as the ones that are displayed on screen. It is possible to change this behavior by specifying yourself which fields must be exported in the ``galette/config/local_export_fields.inc.php`` file. If for example you only want identifier, first and last member names, the content of the file will be:"
msgstr ""
"Privzeto bo izvoz CSV za izbor članov prikazal enaka polja kot tista, ki so "
"prikazana na zaslonu. To vedenje je mogoče spremeniti tako, da v datoteki "
"``galette/config/local_export_fields.inc.php`` sami določite, katera polja "
"je treba izvoziti. Če na primer želite samo identifikator, ime in priimek "
"člana, bo vsebina datoteke:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:97
#: 2aea5f21892d429ca03289ff2da35812
msgid "E-Mailing"
msgstr "Pošiljanje e-pošte"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:99
#: 2ffcd3463ea942478555cb0c5dbb63ea
msgid "**Mailings in Galette are designed to work from the members list.**"
msgstr ""
"**Poštna sporočila v Galette so zasnovana tako, da delujejo s seznama "
"članov.**"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:101
#: 6a2449424d4b4974ae288e8f192ade33
msgid "Direct mailing creation will work without problems, but members selection is harder."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjanje neposredne pošte bo delovalo brez težav, vendar je izbira članov "
"težja."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:103
#: 5b51977f68d94771afc37946ef1cfe3f
msgid "From Galette, you can send mailings to a selection of members. Each sent mailing is stored in order to be reused, so you can select a stored mailing to be used as a template, retrieving selected members list, mailing subject and contents."
msgstr ""
"Iz Galette lahko pošiljate e-pošto izbranim članom. Vsaka poslana pošta se "
"shrani za ponovno uporabo, tako da lahko izberete shranjeno pošto, ki jo "
"boste uporabili kot predlogo, pri čemer pridobite izbrani seznam članov, "
"zadevo in vsebino pošte."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:105
#: d05b6978063e45ed86ffbe9e8ff7cf18
msgid "To send a new mailing, select members from the list and then use the `Send an email` button at the bottom of the list. If some of selected members does not have an email address, Galette will propose you to print corresponding labels."
msgstr ""
"Za pošiljanje novega sporočila izberite člane s seznama in nato uporabite "
"gumb »Pošlji e-pošto« na dnu seznama. Če kateri od izbranih članov nima e-"
"poštnega naslova, vam bo Galette predlagal tiskanje ustreznih nalepk."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:107
#: 5896d1a1052b41fe9dee62d9318564a7
msgid "Selected members for mailing"
msgstr "Izbrani člani za pošiljanje po pošti"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:112
#: d56d0ebb34c44e82be3386c79589514a
msgid "Selecting members in the list must be done on one page only. Filtering features, as well as the possibility to display all members will be useful ;)"
msgstr ""
"Izbira članov na seznamu mora biti opravljena samo na eni strani. Funkcije "
"filtriranja in možnost prikaza vseh članov bodo koristne ;)"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:116
#: b43af1a893334ebd8d2ffc9fd64c434f
msgid "You can choose a sender for each mailing:"
msgstr "Za vsako pošto lahko izberete pošiljatelja:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:118
#: d0819adda07749daa1dd20dd38761450
msgid "**from Galette preferences** (default value): this will use information stored in preferences,"
msgstr ""
"**iz nastavitev Galette** (privzeta vrednost): to bo uporabilo podatke, "
"shranjene v nastavitvah,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:119
#: eedcb1a13df34ab4b9badcd9491e4053
msgid "**current logged-in user**: will use the name and the email of the current logged-in user (not available for super admin),"
msgstr ""
"**trenutno prijavljeni uporabnik**: uporabilo bo ime in e-poštni naslov "
"trenutno prijavljenega uporabnika (ni na voljo za super administratorja),"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:120
#: 15b160e5918f4e38ac39d87263ae7db9
msgid "**other**: you can set any name and email address you want."
msgstr "**drugo**: nastavite lahko poljubno ime in e-poštni naslov."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:122
#: 64108243a0fe4d42a34b5ed1c4d5235b
msgid "Sender selection"
msgstr "Izbira pošiljatelja"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:127
#: 5725e99d780344e193a8a8f60be178df
msgid "Once the subject has been filled, you can work on the contents. You can send email in text only, or in HTML (keep in mind sending HTML messages by mail is often not the way to go). A simple HTML WYSIWYG editor is provided."
msgstr ""
"Ko izpolnite zadevo, lahko delate na vsebini. E-pošto lahko pošljete samo v "
"obliki besedila ali v obliki HTML (upoštevajte, da pošiljanje sporočil HTML "
"po pošti pogosto ni prava pot). Na voljo je preprost WYSIWYG urejevalnik "
"HTML."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:129
#: 9964f2f45b8745348c9c2583f74b757c
msgid "Once the HTML editor is enabled, the checkbox to handle HTML tags is automatically checked, remember to check the box if you do not use the editor but want to send HTML!"
msgstr ""
"Ko je urejevalnik HTML omogočen, se potrditveno polje za obdelavo oznak HTML "
"samodejno potrdi. Ne pozabite potrditi polja, če urejevalnika ne "
"uporabljate, vendar želite poslati HTML!"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:131
#: daaacbf33ca54093bd54afeef42d7da0
msgid "Even if Galette is able to send HTML emails, this is discouraged. Messages length will be way larger (for almost nothing), and some (like me!) read their emails as text only. That is why Galette will **always** provide a text version of HTML emails."
msgstr ""
"Tudi če Galette lahko pošilja e-poštna sporočila v obliki HTML, to ni "
"priporočljivo. Sporočila bodo veliko daljša (skoraj za nič), nekateri (kot "
"jaz!) pa bodo svoja e-poštna sporočila brali samo kot besedilo. Zato bo "
"Galette **vedno** zagotovil besedilno različico e-poštnih sporočil v obliki "
"HTML."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:133
#: 5e374f097326472abbb0bfea92411b08
msgid "It is also possible to add attachements, just click on the `Browse` button in that attachements section. If your browser is compatible, you can add several files at once (using `Shift` and `Ctrl` keys). All attachements are stored on disk, under a directory named with the mailing identifier (automatically defined from database)."
msgstr ""
"Dodati je mogoče tudi priloge, samo kliknite gumb »Prebrskaj« v razdelku s "
"prilogami. Če je vaš brskalnik združljiv, lahko dodate več datotek hkrati (z "
"uporabo tipk »Shift« in »Ctrl«). Vse priloge so shranjene na disku, v "
"imeniku, poimenovanem z identifikatorjem pošte (samodejno določenim iz baze "
"podatkov)."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:136
#: b588f7c454ac4f23b6e558c821f1e581
msgid "`Preview` button let you preview your message before sending it."
msgstr "Gumb »Predogled« vam omogoča predogled sporočila, preden ga pošljete."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:138
#: 6b3b6683a6f742c5b056de1fed766ffb
msgid "Preview message"
msgstr "Predogled sporočila"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:143
#: d02d0fac4ecb4741b4fc8b6ee4a240e9
msgid "Any started emailings will be stored in your session to be retrieved in the future. An icon will be displayed in pages titles when a mailing is progress and will provide a link to go to it."
msgstr ""
"Vsa začeta e-poštna sporočila bodo shranjena v vaši seji za kasnejši dostop. "
"Med pošiljanjem e-pošte bo v naslovih strani prikazana ikona, ki bo "
"vsebovala povezavo do nje."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:145
#: 0bdf241274e2439f9055eb30c33f2f1e
msgid "If you want, you can cancel this mailing using the `Cancel mailing` button, it will be deleted from your session. If you want to store it for a longer time, you can add the `Save` button. It will then be stored in the mailings list, and you will be able to grab it later."
msgstr ""
"Če želite, lahko to pošiljanje prekličete z gumbom »Prekliči pošiljanje«, s "
"čimer bo izbrisano iz vaše seje. Če ga želite shraniti dlje časa, lahko "
"dodate gumb »Shrani«. Sporočilo bo nato shranjeno na seznam prejemnikov in "
"ga boste lahko prevzeli pozneje."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:148
#: dcc74c1381e443ff8db505aaa51d3c8e
msgid "Mailings history"
msgstr "Zgodovina pošiljanj"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:150
#: b564deab888641db99724c1d95bc1438
msgid "When you start a mailing, it is stored into your session. Session ends when users log out, or on a server defined timeout. Mailing history stores the mailing in the database, this ensure it will always be available in the future."
msgstr ""
"Ko začnete pošiljati pošto, se ta shrani v vašo sejo. Seja se konča, ko se "
"uporabniki odjavijo ali po preteku časovne omejitve, ki jo določi strežnik. "
"Zgodovina pošiljanja shrani pošto v podatkovno bazo, kar zagotavlja, da bo v "
"prihodnje vedno na voljo."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:152
#: 114b440766e04f8cbde2bca533e0ebba
msgid "Every sent mailing is stored into the database, and can be used as a template to write a new one. In this case, a new mailing will be created using information from the history, and the original one will be kept as is."
msgstr ""
"Vsako poslano sporočilo se shrani v podatkovno bazo in ga je mogoče "
"uporabiti kot predlogo za pisanje novega. V tem primeru bo novo sporočilo "
"ustvarjeno z uporabo podatkov iz zgodovine, prvotno sporočilo pa bo "
"ohranjeno takšno, kot je."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:154
#: 75ad268996ed4e0da907b51ea3fde96a
msgid "Mailings can be stored before they are sent. In this case, it is possible to continue it later. When you use history on a draft mailing, original entry will be replaced on sending."
msgstr ""
"Pošiljke je mogoče shraniti, preden so poslane. V tem primeru je mogoče "
"nadaljevati pozneje. Ko uporabite zgodovino za osnutek pošte, bo prvotni "
"vnos ob pošiljanju zamenjan."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:156
#: 4b0e22297d5c4fb1bd80059de2cc1870
msgid "When you use an existing history entry, here are the information that will be used:"
msgstr ""
"Ko uporabite obstoječi vnos v zgodovino, bodo uporabljene naslednje "
"informacije:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:158
#: 3cb1f26280494c8986291bba1b241693
msgid "recipients,"
msgstr "prejemniki,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:159
#: b635e2bce9294fcca3cd50c042776b31
msgid "attachements,"
msgstr "priloge,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:160
#: 3d8ab50c64374df8bd2c025d88fdf03e
msgid "subject,"
msgstr "predmet,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:161
#: c5de0398237446b7add2e64d38fa44f8
msgid "message,"
msgstr "sporočilo,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:162
#: e36a2c5c3c5f4abc9602b892e7a91910
msgid "html/text flag."
msgstr "html/text flag."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:165
#: 2105c78ff8c7443caa6ae2bb54b47fa5
msgid "CSV imports"
msgstr "Uvoz CSV-ja"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:167
#: ee5f498e833a4983ad822776069a5515
msgid "It is possible to import member data from a predefined model. A default model is provided, but you can configure it to suits your needs, using the `Imports` menu entry."
msgstr ""
"Podatke o članih je mogoče uvoziti iz vnaprej določenega modela. Na voljo je "
"privzeti model, vendar ga lahko konfigurirate glede na svoje potrebe z "
"uporabo menija »Uvozi«."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:170
#: bde381412e244dd893a4b5a8ccc0fdfd
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:172
#: 239940f880234df49f9749065f8c9445
msgid "Import model defines fields and their order in a CSV file. When importing, current model will be used to check your CSV file integrity."
msgstr ""
"Model uvoza določa polja in njihov vrstni red v datoteki CSV. Pri uvozu bo "
"za preverjanje celovitosti datoteke CSV uporabljen trenutni model."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:174
#: 323648ae7da84ec3a4f0ecc7e4093c61
msgid "To configure the model, click on the `Configure` button from the UI."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo modela kliknite gumb »Konfiguriraj« v uporabniškem vmesniku."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:176
#: 7a3452b703654fd788ab1290ab9d9f9d
msgid "Default import model"
msgstr "Privzeti model uvoza"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:181
#: 844f10481e32499a9d381c169249b5db
msgid "If proposed model is not ok for you, click on `Edit model` and choose your fields:"
msgstr ""
"Če vam predlagani model ne ustreza, kliknite na »Uredi model« in izberite "
"polja:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:183
#: 2065c32b17b9433c82460219309e4595
msgid "Import model configuration"
msgstr "Uvozi konfiguracijo modela"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:188
#: 745b042c0c54450f8b04397dfb178004
msgid "Once you have selected your fields, click on the `Store new model` button."
msgstr "Ko izberete polja, kliknite gumb »Shrani nov model«."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:190
#: c72df9941cb444e79105459053e0ad14
msgid "When in the current model tab, you can download an empty model from the `Generate an empty CSV file` button. Of course, you can change model if you want, or remove it to get the default model back."
msgstr ""
"Ko ste na zavihku trenutnega modela, lahko s klikom na gumb »Ustvari prazno "
"datoteko CSV« prenesete prazen model. Seveda lahko model po želji spremenite "
"ali pa ga odstranite, da dobite nazaj privzeti model."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:193
#: d4b3193315fd4768821fae95b7883e7b
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Uvoz"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:195
#: 7f2c81a7a84242b29ff995171f20d185
msgid "Once you have retrieved and fill the empty file, you have to send it using the form `Send a new file`. At this step, Galette will check your file extension is ``csv`` (or ``txt``) and it size does not exceed maximum upload file size (2Mio per default in PHP)."
msgstr ""
"Ko pridobite in izpolnite prazno datoteko, jo morate poslati z uporabo "
"obrazca `Pošlji novo datoteko`. V tem koraku bo Galette preveril, ali je "
"končnica vaše datoteke ``csv`` (ali ``txt``) in ali njena velikost ne "
"presega največje velikosti datoteke za nalaganje (privzeto 2 milijona v PHP)."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:199
#: 56153cccf8ca44d5aeecf2506d060ef2
msgid "If you want to import a huge file, you can put it from your FTP client in the ``galette/data/imports`` directory, or split it into several smaller files you can import one by one."
msgstr ""
"Če želite uvoziti veliko datoteko, jo lahko iz odjemalca FTP shranite v "
"imenik ``galette/data/imports`` ali pa jo razdelite na več manjših datotek, "
"ki jih lahko uvozite eno za drugo."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:201
#: dcabc844bade4b2481bfc37f9a91d55e
msgid "Sent files are listed in the `Existing files` section. You can show, remove or import it:"
msgstr ""
"Poslane datoteke so navedene v razdelku »Obstoječe datoteke«. Lahko jih "
"prikažete, odstranite ali uvozite:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:203
#: 876843089026455a88c98cedb61257b0
msgid "Select and import file"
msgstr "Izberite in uvozite datoteko"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:208
#: e88f3904d8654eabaf2aea335a22e2dc
msgid "The `dry run` checkbox (checked per default) is designed to test your file data are valid (mandatory fields filled, data formatting is correct, ...) without storing anything in the database."
msgstr ""
"Potrditveno polje »poskusni zagon« (privzeto označeno) je namenjeno "
"preverjanju veljavnosti podatkov v datoteki (izpolnjenost obveznih polj, "
"pravilno oblikovanje podatkov itd.), ne da bi se pri tem karkoli shranilo v "
"bazo podatkov."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:210
#: 8abd4ece23a14f4eaa31a824640112de
msgid "When you import a CSV file, if one line is incorrect, previous ones may be stored in the database already; so it is advised to use the dry-run before to get error fixed."
msgstr ""
"Ko uvozite datoteko CSV in če je ena vrstica napačna, so lahko prejšnje že "
"shranjene v zbirki podatkov; zato je priporočljivo, da pred tem uporabite "
"poskusni zagon, da odpravite napako."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:212
#: 0f34549a281f49629338ea78f9575288
msgid "You will have error messages than something went wrong (in dry-run mode or not):"
msgstr ""
"Prikazala se bodo sporočila o napakah, ki kažejo, da je šlo kaj narobe (v "
"poskusnem načinu ali ne):"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:216
#: 107346bc7fad4bbe92de8b41c7223bf5
msgid "You may see mandatory missing fields even if import is ok. This may happen when all the fields you set as required in Galette configuration are not listed in your import model."
msgstr ""
"Obvezna polja se lahko pojavijo, tudi če je uvoz uspešen. Do tega lahko "
"pride, če vsa polja, ki ste jih v konfiguraciji Galette nastavili kot "
"obvezna, niso navedena v vašem modelu uvoza."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:221
#: aac09ca89fbb40d49d8bac722afd755f
msgid "Links between members"
msgstr "Povezave med člani"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:225
#: d112e53ef88145ce91bc5216faa050d0
msgid "You can link several members to a \"parent\" one. This may be used to store families for exemple, or members of a same company. You can access children members from the parent, and parent from the children."
msgstr ""
"Več članov lahko povežete z enim \"nadrejenim\". To se lahko na primer "
"uporabi za shranjevanje družin ali članov istega podjetja. Do podrejenih "
"članov lahko dostopate iz nadrejenega člana, do nadrejenih pa iz podrejenih "
"članov."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:227
#: 4fe4c4d7a78844469832350645ca8b8b
msgid "You can add as many child as you want for a member, but a child cannot become a parent."
msgstr ""
"Članu lahko dodate poljubno število otrok, vendar otrok ne more postati "
"starš."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:229
#: eafd9a8411d748bf94aaa776fff6450c
msgid "The other interesting point of this system is you can retrieve some information from the parent when sending mailings or labels. In the children members, email and postal addresses automatically become optional, whatever the configuration says. If any of those information is missing, it will be retrieved from the parent."
msgstr ""
"Druga zanimivost tega sistema je, da lahko pri pošiljanju pošte ali nalepk "
"pridobite nekatere podatke od nadrejenega elementa. Pri podrejenih članih e-"
"poštni in poštni naslovi samodejno postanejo neobvezni, ne glede na to, kaj "
"določa konfiguracija. Če kateri od teh podatkov manjka, bo pridobljen od "
"nadrejenega elementa."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:231
#: 1562502f406a40bc88bc9c819c671100
msgid "Members without email adresses cannot use the \"retrieve password\" feature. This does not affect the uniqueness email constraint in the database."
msgstr ""
"Člani brez e-poštnih naslovov ne morejo uporabljati funkcije »pridobi geslo"
"«. To ne vpliva na omejitev edinstvenosti e-poštnih naslovov v zbirki "
"podatkov."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:234
#: 223e5cf58e9a4d5ba43063bb9c04959a
msgid "Impersonating"
msgstr "Lažno predstavljanje"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:238
#: bb0f420d1f604de1b8cd064e390f2a6d
msgid "Some issues may be related to a particular account, because of its ACLs, groups, ... In this case, it is unfortunately frequent to see some credentials sent by insecure emails; which should really be avoid."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere težave so lahko povezane z določenim računom zaradi njegovih ACL-"
"jev, skupin itd. V tem primeru je žal pogosto videti, da so nekatere "
"poverilnice poslane prek nezaščitenih e-poštnih sporočil; čemur se je res "
"treba izogniti."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:240
#: a8ed88e12f534928933fcd5ab047b5a1
msgid "As super administrator user, you will see an extra icon in the members list, allowing you to log in as selected user without his credentials. Once you've impersonated the user, you can reproduce the issue and fix it or get all required information to report the issue upstream."
msgstr ""
"Kot super administrator boste na seznamu članov videli dodatno ikono, ki vam "
"bo omogočila prijavo kot izbrani uporabnik brez njegovih poverilnic. Ko se "
"boste izdajali za uporabnika, lahko težavo reproducirate in jo odpravite ali "
"pa pridobite vse potrebne informacije za prijavo težave naprej."
